@startuml
title Handshake TCP normal y ataque SYN flood

== Handshake normal ==
CLIENT -> SERVER: SYN (SEQ=x)
SERVER -> CLIENT: SYN-ACK (SEQ=y, ACK=x+1)
CLIENT -> SERVER: ACK (SEQ=x+1, ACK=y+1)
note right: ESTABLISHED

== SYN flood (spoofing) ==
ATTACKER -> SERVER: SYN (SEQ=a, SRC=spoofed)
SERVER -> SPOOFED: SYN-ACK (SEQ=b, ACK=a+1)
note right: Servidor entra en SYN-RCVD\nocupa cola SYN
ATTACKER -> SERVER: SYN (SEQ=c, SRC=spoofed2)
SERVER -> SPOOFED2: SYN-ACK (SEQ=d, ACK=c+1)
note right: Cola SYN se llena\n(tcp_max_syn_backlog)

== Conexión legítima bloqueada ==
CLIENT -> SERVER: SYN (SEQ=e)
SERVER --> CLIENT: (sin respuesta o descartada)
note right: SYN-ACK no enviado\npor cola llena

@enduml